{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"GEN","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"创世记","commonName":"创世记","title":"创世记","order":1,"numberOfChapters":50,"sha256":"cce15cc7fd65c9f16227e0f34f3b0514633bfb9ef883e0936d6560885eb025fb","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/GEN/1.json","lastChapterNumber":50,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/GEN/50.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1532},"chapter":{"number":16,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["夏甲和以实玛利"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["亚伯兰的妻子撒莱不给他生儿女。撒莱有一个使女，名叫夏甲，是埃及人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["撒莱对亚伯兰说：「耶和华使我不能生育。求你和我的使女同房，或者我可以因她得孩子",{"noteId":7},"。」亚伯兰听从了撒莱的话。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["于是亚伯兰的妻子撒莱将使女埃及人夏甲给了丈夫为妾；那时亚伯兰在迦南已经住了十年。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["亚伯兰与夏甲同房，夏甲就怀了孕；她见自己有孕，就小看她的主母。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["撒莱对亚伯兰说：「我因你受屈。我将我的使女放在你怀中，她见自己有了孕，就小看我。愿耶和华在你我中间判断。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["亚伯兰对撒莱说：「使女在你手下，你可以随意待她。」撒莱苦待她，她就从撒莱面前逃走了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["耶和华的使者在旷野书珥路上的水泉旁遇见她，"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["对她说：「撒莱的使女夏甲，你从哪里来？要往哪里去？」夏甲说：「我从我的主母撒莱面前逃出来。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["耶和华的使者对她说：「你回到你主母那里，服在她手下」；"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["又说：「我必使你的后裔极其繁多，甚至不可胜数」；"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["并说：「你如今怀孕要生一个儿子，可以给他起名叫以实玛利",{"noteId":8},"，因为耶和华听见了你的苦情。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["他为人必像野驴。他的手要攻打人，人的手也要攻打他；他必住在众弟兄的东边。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["夏甲就称那对她说话的耶和华为「看顾人的 神」。因而说：「在这里我也看见那看顾我的吗？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["所以这井名叫庇耳·拉海·莱。这井正在加低斯和巴列中间。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["后来夏甲给亚伯兰生了一个儿子；亚伯兰给他起名叫以实玛利。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["夏甲给亚伯兰生以实玛利的时候，亚伯兰年八十六岁。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":7,"caller":"-","text":"得孩子：原文是被建立","reference":{"chapter":16,"verse":2}},{"noteId":8,"caller":"-","text":"就是 神听见的意思","reference":{"chapter":16,"verse":11}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/GEN/16.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/GEN/17.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/GEN/15.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":16}